				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Ways of working: GOOS( outside-in TDD)"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-27T23:44:01.496959+03:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-27T23:50:10.278297+03:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "9CGqSeQGSMu9UfBj8ugt5g=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "I will follow *Growing Object-Oriented Software, Guided by Tests* (Freeman & Pryce).\n\nSince I'm not familiar enough yet with GT, Pharo and everything in-between, this is one of the best ways of working. I will try to create a walking skeleton, the thinnest slice imaginable to kickstart this ambitious, at least for me, project."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
